                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>Employee well-being events, such as our global &amp;quot;AbbVie in Motion&amp;quot; exercise challenge, provide opportunities to make connections with colleagues while promoting healthy behaviors. Together, AbbVie colleagues around the world logged more than 19 million physical activity minutes during 2022's four-week team challenge.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
